### 1️⃣ Register
POST {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "name": "mena",
  "email": "mennatallaadel6@gmail.com",
  "password": "Password12366",
  "phoneNumber": "0123456789"

}



### 2️⃣ Login 
POST {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mennatallaadel6@gmail.com",
  "password": "Password12366"
}

### 3️⃣ Verify Email 
POST {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/api/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mennatallaadel6@gmail.com",
  "code": "8898"
}

### 4️⃣ Resend Verification Code 
POST {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/api/auth/resend-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{
 
    "email": "alaasamer222004@gmail.com"
  
}

### 1️⃣ Forgot Password — يبعث OTP على الإيميل
POST {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alaasamer222004@gmail.com"
}

### 2️⃣ Verify Reset Code — تأكيد صحة الـ OTP قبل شاشة تغيير الباسورد
POST {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/api/auth/verify-reset-code
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alaasamer222004@gmail.com",
  "code": "1507"
}

### 3️⃣ Reset Password — تغيير الباسورد (بعد ما الـ OTP يتأكد)
POST {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "d5bc55b4d07e4182a01726296a1826a7",
  "newPassword": "123456",
  "confirmPassword": "123456"
}

### 7️⃣ Social Login 
POST {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/api/auth/social-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "google",
  "token": "social_token_here"
}
### 8️⃣ Search Artifacts

POST {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/api/search
Content-Type: application/json
{
"query": "ram",
  "type": "statue",
  "page": 1,
  "pageSize": 10
}
### 9️⃣ Logout
POST {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json
{
  
}


### ---------- تيست البروفيل (Profile) ----------
# الخطوات:
# 1. شغّل المشروع (F5 أو dotnet run)
# 2. نفّذ "Login للبروفيل" تحت كده (نفس إيميل وباسورد الـ Register)
# 3. من الـ Response انسخ: userId و token
# 4. حط الـ userId مكان {{UserId}} والـ token مكان {{Token}} في المتغيرات تحت
# 5. نفّذ "Get Profile" ثم "Update Profile" لو حابّة


@UserId = 13d18f1c-b172-424b-a8ff-e23035a70514
@Token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..UH5a593sBZaaQXmuCzQzwXikIRh0HUae5-bv9AqNF9w


### Get Profile (جلب بيانات اليوزر — بعد ما تحط UserId و Token فوق)
GET {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{UserId}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}




